class.description:
SpacetimeDBClient provides a real-time WebSocket connection to a SpacetimeDB database. It handles the v1.json.spacetimedb or v1.bsatn.spacetimedb protocol, manages a local client-side cache of subscribed table rows, and allows calling server-side reducers. Typical usage from GDScript: [codeblock] var client = SpacetimeDBClient.new() client.connected.connect(_on_connected) client.row_inserted.connect(_on_row_inserted) client.connect_to_database("ws://localhost:3000", "my_database")
func _process(delta): client.poll()
func _on_connected(identity, token): client.subscribe(PackedStringArray(["SELECT * FROM person"]))
func _on_row_inserted(table_name, row): print("New row in ", table_name, ": ", row) [/codeblock]
